meta {
  name: getMetaClassifications
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getMetaClassifications",
    "params": {
      "limit": 2
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve ETIM meta-classification definitions

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `custom_classification_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by custom classification IDs |
  | `custom_class_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by custom class IDs |
  | `custom_class_code` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by custom class codes |
  | `custom_collection_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by custom collection IDs |
  | `entity_type` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by entity type (e.g. etim_feature, etim_value, custom_feature) |
  | `etim_feature_codes` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by ETIM feature codes (e.g. ["EF000001"]) |
  | `etim_value_codes` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by ETIM value codes (e.g. ["EV000001"]) |
  | `custom_feature_ids` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by custom feature IDs |
  | `include_languages` | string[] (nullable) | no | Language codes to include in translations (e.g. ["nl", "fr"]) |

  **Example: All meta classifications**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getMetaClassifications",
    "params": {
      "limit": 2
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "meta_classifications": [
      {
        "custom_classification_id": 1,
        "custom_class_id": 1,
        "entity_type": "etim_feature",
        "etim_feature_code": "EF000003",
        "custom_feature_id": 5
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 2,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
